### Seed ClubElo snapshot
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/elo/seed
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}

{
  "date_str": "2025-08-01",
  "season": "2025"
}

###

### Seed with an explicit override for a provider name gap
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/elo/seed
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}

{
  "date_str": "2025-08-01",
  "season": "2025",
  "manual_entries": [
    {
      "team_name": "Leeds",
      "elo_raw": 1660,
      "reason": "Verified against ClubElo history on 2025-08-01"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Recalculate ELO ratings (SFA internal IDs: La Liga=1, PL=3, Bundesliga=6, Serie A=7, Ligue 1=9)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/elo/recalculate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}

{
  "season": "2025",
  "competition_ids": [1, 3, 6, 7, 9],
  "k_factors": {
    "1": 30,
    "3": 30,
    "6": 30,
    "7": 30,
    "9": 30
  },
  "default_k": 30.0,
  "participant_kind": "club"
}

###

### Recalculate ELO with higher K for Champions League (SFA internal ID: Champions League=10)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/elo/recalculate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}

{
  "season": "2024",
  "competition_ids": [1, 3, 10],
  "k_factors": {
    "1": 30,
    "3": 30,
    "10": 35
  },
  "default_k": 30.0
}

###

### Error case: invalid date
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/elo/seed
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{admin_key}}

{
  "date_str": "not-a-date",
  "season": "2024"
}
